{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14033","headline":"仙山行 · 耿湋","name":"仙山行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深溪人不到，杖策独缘源。\n花落寻无径，鸡鸣觉近村。\n数翁皆藉草，对[弈]复倾尊。\n看毕初爲局，归逢几世孙。\n云迷入洞处，水引出山门。\n惆怅归城郭，樵柯迹尚存。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}